851
01:17:08,091 --> 01:17:11,327
- I'm not thirsty.
- Morris, come on.

852
01:17:11,394 --> 01:17:13,863
Y-You're pale,
you got the shakes.
I'll get the drink.

853
01:17:13,930 --> 01:17:16,332
I'm not thirsty, Richard.
Don't go in there, Richard.

854
01:17:21,370 --> 01:17:23,840
