Oh, come on!

874
01:19:11,314 --> 01:19:14,750
Richard!

875
01:19:16,285 --> 01:19:18,454
Come here.
Here.

876
01:19:24,928 --> 01:19:28,131
Stop.
Now, turn around.

877
01:19:42,578 --> 01:19:46,382
Edgar, that damn
fiddle player
is right behind us.

878
01:19:49,652 --> 01:19:52,488
