889
01:20:43,839 --> 01:20:47,210
Yes. Yes.
[ Engine Starts ]

890
01:20:47,276 --> 01:20:49,445
Yes, yes, yes, yes.
[ Tires Screeching ]

891
01:20:53,416 --> 01:20:55,584
[ Groans ]

892
