[ Edgar ]
Well, I think we've lost
your young man, my dear.

895
01:21:18,841 --> 01:21:21,344
I say good riddance
to bad baggage.

896
01:21:21,410 --> 01:21:23,346
[ Horn Honking ]

897
01:21:37,626 --> 01:21:39,695
- Good grief, there he is.
- [ Natalie ]
