920
01:24:10,513 --> 01:24:12,981
Maddy, dear,
don't be foolish.
What do you think?

921
01:24:13,048 --> 01:24:15,284
What do you say, honey?

922
01:24:17,753 --> 01:24:21,390
What do you say, huh?

923
01:24:21,457 --> 01:24:25,128
