925
01:24:44,480 --> 01:24:48,584
Okay. Okay.

926
01:24:48,651 --> 01:24:52,788
Okay. Okay!

927
01:24:58,927 --> 01:25:01,364
Maddy! Maddy!

928
01:25:33,796 --> 01:25:37,666
[ Shouts ]
Oh, shit.

929
01:25:37,733 --> 01:25:41,170
That's the man
you're after--
Burton L. Cooper.

930
01:25:41,237 --> 01:25:46,141
[ Grunts ]
Civil servant...
dumb morons!

931
01:25:46,209 --> 01:25:48,477
